    "text": "Meg spends a fortnight with the rich Moffats, and is {ASHAMED} of her old dresses. For a party the Moffat girls {POWDER} and curl her, and squeeze her into a borrowed blue {SILK}. Laurie is there, and does not like it: “I wouldn’t, Meg.” Meg {FLIRTS}, drinks {CHAMPAGNE}, and comes home sorry, to tell Marmee {EVERYTHING}.",
